    and their total. `notes`: every assumption the call made.
    """
    frame: pl.DataFrame
    dropped: pl.DataFrame
    r: pl.DataFrame
    panel: dict[str, Any]
    requests: dict[str, int]
    notes: list[str]
    exposure_dataset: dict[str, Any] | None
